DateTime←{
⍝ (params value) of a DATE or DATE-TIME → minutes since day 0, Toronto local time
    params v←⍵
    tz←5↓¨params/⍨'TZID='∘≡¨5↑¨params
    ~∧/tz∊⊂'America/Toronto':('Time zone not understood by the tests: ',⊃tz)⎕SIGNAL 11
    8=≢v:(1440×('YYYYMMDD' 1)⎕DT⊂v)+(60×23)+59     ⍝ a DATE (in UNTIL) covers the whole day
    z←'Z'=⊃⌽v                                        ⍝ ⎕DT parses the Z but doesn't convert
    t←⊃(('YYYYMMDD"T"hhmmss',z/'"Z"')¯1)⎕DT⊂v
    m←(1440×1 ⎕DT⊂3↑t)+60⊥t[4 5]
    z:TorontoFromUTC m
    m
}
